# Build context for the four dataprocessing-based MCP server images is this
# mcp/ directory (agentcore-stack.ts), so this .dockerignore governs what is
# uploaded to the Docker daemon for those builds.
#
# The four Dockerfiles COPY <server>/requirements.txt, <server>/server.py and
# vendor/awslabs_aws_dataprocessing_mcp_server/awslabs/ — nothing else. Entries
# below are either not COPY'd or locally generated; a locally generated file in
# the context changes the asset hash on every synth.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.venv
**/.DS_Store
**/README.md
**/pyproject.toml
**/test_*.py
